# Catch the falling stars with the basket.
basket is a 🧺 at bottom center, size 60
⭐ falls 3
score is 0

every 1 second:
    make a ⭐ at random x, top

when left key is pressed: move basket left 10
when right key is pressed: move basket right 10

when basket touches ⭐:
    add 1 to score
    remove that ⭐
    say "Score: {score}"
